  "description": "POJCOK crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C116 H100 Dy4 N20 Ni4 O32,10(C1 H4 O1),13(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Ni1 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni2 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Ni3 (Ni) has 5 O neighbors; Ni4 (Ni) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately linear metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.176-3.925 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.86-112.39°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ni4Dy4(L)6(L')2{(py)2C(OCH3)O}2(μ3-CO3)2(CH3OH)2]·10CH3OH·13H2O.",
